{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"2622a6751e049f93","type":"group","x":-1680,"y":460,"width":5400,"height":930,"label":"Node Details"},
		{"id":"e740537b4fe12739","type":"group","x":2320,"y":-680,"width":840,"height":880,"label":"Node details"},
		{"id":"fb3adcf8a4ec3646","type":"group","x":-620,"y":-240,"width":2180,"height":160,"label":"Image prompt generator"},
		{
			"id":"13bc1c1541768919",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Node name:\n\n### input:\n### Process:\n### Output:",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2840,
			"y":-335,
			"width":260,
			"height":230
		},
		{
			"id":"af604a57e7d69659",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## generate image\n* image will be generated based on the prompt provided.\n\n## feedback (agent node)\n* this node will analyse the image generated against the prompt and score  out of 10. \n* if score more than >=7 save the image. \n* else suggest the improvements. \n\n## store image node\n* this will store the image in minio\n\n## end node\n* this node will stop the workflow",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2780,
			"y":-570,
			"width":360,
			"height":660
		},
		{
			"id":"8bdb0b27eb2e686a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## End Node\n\n## input: \n\n- Workflow completion signal.\n\n## Process:\n\n- Finalizes the execution of the workflow.\n- Releases any allocated resources and marks the process as completed.\n\n## output:\n- Workflow terminated successfully.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3260,
			"y":880,
			"width":440,
			"height":455
		},
		{
			"id":"0ac9948625abb3cf",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Store Image (Storage Node)\n\n## input: \n\n- Approved generated image (score ≥ 7).\n- Associated metadata (e.g., prompt, timestamp, image identifier).\n\n## Process:\n\n- Uploads and stores the approved image in MinIO.\n- Persists any required metadata for future retrieval and reference.\n- Generates a storage reference or object identifier.\n\n## output:\n- Image successfully stored in MinIO.\n- Storage path or object ID.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2700,
			"y":845,
			"width":440,
			"height":525
		},
		{
			"id":"3563c1da6f76a7d7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Feedback (Agent Node)\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":880,
			"y":-220,
			"width":180,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"4e17f8fce7024dd9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Input Query (Input Form)",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-340,
			"y":-220,
			"width":200,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"d42ab718876dce0b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Clarification (Agent Node)",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-80,
			"y":-220,
			"width":180,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"a4426de31a7020d7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Clarification Response (Input Form)",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":160,
			"y":-220,
			"width":180,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"16b0304f0992c327",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Start Node (Trigger Node)**",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-600,
			"y":-220,
			"width":180,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"bfe6df30448f3541",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"End Node",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1360,
			"y":-220,
			"width":180,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"815cd5dca6e4d6f2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Generate Image (Image Generation Node)",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":660,
			"y":-220,
			"width":180,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"7e83165885e9bef5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Store Image (Storage Node)",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":1120,
			"y":-220,
			"width":180,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"1a74e45838873fff",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Clarification Response (Input Form)\n\n## input: \n* Clarification questions generated by the agent.\n- User-provided answers to those questions.\n\n## Process:\n\n- Collects and validates the user's responses.\n- Associates the answers with the corresponding clarification questions.\n- Passes the complete clarification context to the prompt generation agent.\n\n## output:\n* Structured clarification questions and user answers",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":260,
			"y":845,
			"width":440,
			"height":520
		},
		{
			"id":"2ee76610506adc32",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Prompt Generation (Agent Node)\n\n## input: \n* Initial user prompt.\n- Clarification questions and corresponding user answers.\n- Prompt quality score and suggested improvements (if available).\n\n## Process:\n\n- Combines the original prompt with the clarification context.\n- Incorporates any quality feedback and improvement suggestions.\n- Produces a detailed, optimized, and unambiguous prompt suitable for image generation.\n\n## output:\n* Final enhanced image generation prompt..",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":860,
			"y":845,
			"width":440,
			"height":525
		},
		{
			"id":"b9fde4b88a30952f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Generate Image (Image Generation Node)\n\n## input: \n\n* Final enhanced image generation prompt.\n\n## Process:\n\n- Sends the optimized prompt to the image generation model.\n- Generates an image based on the provided prompt and specified parameters.\n- Returns the generated image for evaluation.\n\n## output:\n* Generated image.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1500,
			"y":845,
			"width":440,
			"height":525
		},
		{
			"id":"203886427f6498d7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Prompt Generation (Agent Node)",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":420,
			"y":-220,
			"width":180,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"ba37372981f1c492",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **Start Node (Trigger node)**\n* this node is designed for starting the workflow. \n## **Input query (Input form**)\n* Once the workflow is triggered User will provide the vague prompt to generate an image. \n## **clarification (agent node)**\n* it will take the user vague prompt as input analyse it, and ask for clarification questions.\n## input query (input form)\n* in this node user will clarify the queries\n\n## prompt generate (agent node)\n* Based on the clarification, agent will generate the prompt\n* input: \n\t* clarification queries and answers\n\t* initial user prompt\n\t* score and improvisation",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2340,
			"y":-660,
			"width":360,
			"height":840
		},
		{
			"id":"f0fe9e7fc9bbe9e1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **Start Node (Trigger Node)**\n\n### input:\n* User trigger\n### Process: \n* Initializes the workflow execution\n### output:\n* Workflow successfully started and ready to accept the user's image generation request.",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-1660,
			"y":840,
			"width":500,
			"height":530
		},
		{
			"id":"a212a0cf26773dc2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Here's what the code reveals:\n\n**The backend does NOT skip HITL nodes in test mode** — both test and real executions behave identically. The pause at form nodes happens in both.\n\n**The actual problem** is the frontend's Test panel — it pre-seeds the context with all form field values upfront _before_ starting the execution. So when the workflow hits the Input Query form node, `user_prompt` is already in context and the form may not pause as expected.\n\n**To trigger a proper HITL execution**, the frontend doesn't expose a \"Start Real Run\" button. You need to call the API directly:\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \\\n  \"http://localhost:8000/workflows/{workflow_id}/start\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer <your_token>\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{}'\n```\n\nThis starts the execution with an empty context — the workflow will hit Input Query, the form node will inject a `__wait_form` marker, and the executor will pause and wait for the user to submit the form.\n\n**Two things you need:**\n\n1. Your workflow ID (visible in the URL when you're on the canvas)\n2. Your auth token (from browser dev tools → Network tab → any API request → Authorization header)\n\nShare those and I'll give you the exact curl command to run. Or do you want to add a proper \"Trigger\" button to the frontend UI instead?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1800,
			"y":2220,
			"width":840,
			"height":680
		},
		{
			"id":"397080c38dc67180",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Clarification (Agent Node)\n\n## input: \n* initial user prompt\n\n## Process:\n\n* Analyzes the prompt to identify ambiguities, missing details, or unclear requirements.\n- Generates relevant clarification questions to better understand the user's intent.\n- Requests additional information from the user.\n\n## output:\n* List of clarification questions to be answered by the user.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-320,
			"y":845,
			"width":440,
			"height":520
		},
		{
			"id":"6af05a794f98084f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Input Query (Input Form)\n\n### input:\n* User provides an initial, potentially vague prompt describing the image they want to generate\n### Process:\n* Captures the user's request through the input form.\n- Validates that a prompt has been provided.\n- Forwards the prompt to the clarification agent for further analysis\n### output:\n* Initial user prompt available for clarification. ",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-980,
			"y":840,
			"width":440,
			"height":530
		},
		{
			"id":"9da59536a1a0f1ba",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Feedback (Agent Node)\n\n## input: \n\n* Generated image.\n- Final enhanced image generation prompt.\n\n## Process:\n\n- Compares the generated image against the intended prompt and evaluates how well it satisfies the requirements.\n- Assigns a quality score on a scale of 0 to 10.\n- If the score is **greater than or equal to 7**, approves the image for storage.\n- Otherwise, identifies deficiencies and provides actionable improvement suggestions for regenerating the image.\n- regeneration of image takes maximum of 3 times. \n\n## output:\n* Quality score (0–10).\n- Approval status (Approved/Needs Improvement).\n- Improvement suggestions (if the score is less than 7).",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2100,
			"y":845,
			"width":440,
			"height":525
		}
	],
